#!name=小蚕霸王餐 自动签到（内存优化版）
#!desc=限制响应体大小为128KB，防止内存溢出；定时+拦截双模式

[MITM]
hostname = %APPEND% gw.xiaocantech.com

[Script]
小蚕霸王餐定时 = type=cron,argument=xcbwc_data,cronexp=0 8 * * *,wake-system=1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lylywayr/NetWork-Module/main/Surge/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97-%E5%B0%8F%E8%9A%95%E9%9C%B8%E7%8E%8B%E9%A4%90%E7%AD%BE%E5%88%B0-%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96/xcbwc.js,script-update-interval=0
小蚕霸王餐拦截 = type=http-response,pattern=^https:\/\/gw\.xiaocantech\.com\/rpc,requires-body=1,max-size=131072,binary-body-mode=1,script-path=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lylywayr/NetWork-Module/main/Surge/%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97-%E5%B0%8F%E8%9A%95%E9%9C%B8%E7%8E%8B%E9%A4%90%E7%AD%BE%E5%88%B0-%E5%86%85%E5%AD%98%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96/xcbwc.js,script-update-interval=0,argument=xcbwc_data